msgid "WP_Filesystem credentials request"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:311
msgid "Use of the WP_Filesystem abstraction or a request for filesystem credentials."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:312
msgid "WP_Filesystem can still read plugin and theme files on WordPress VIP, but the web servers are read-only, so anything it writes outside /tmp fails, and its directory operations do not work as expected on the uploads file system."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:313
msgid "Use WP_Filesystem only to read. Write scratch files with wp_tempnam() under get_temp_dir(), and store media through the WordPress upload APIs, which the WordPress VIP stream wrapper handles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:322
msgid "upload_dir filter changes the media location"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:328
