msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:537
msgid "Pass \"no\" for autoload unless the option is genuinely needed on most requests, and keep autoloaded values small."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:538
msgid "For data read on a handful of screens, a transient or a custom table is a better fit than an autoloaded option."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:558
msgid "Raw cURL instead of the WordPress HTTP API"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:564
msgid "A direct cURL call."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:565
