msgid "Replace the cURL handle with the WordPress HTTP API. For front-end GET requests use wpcom_vip_file_get_contents(), which caches the response; otherwise use vip_safe_wp_remote_get() or wp_safe_remote_post() with a timeout of 3 seconds or less."
msgstr ""

