msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:602
msgid "Outbound requests on WordPress VIP are documented for HTTP through the WordPress HTTP API only. Raw sockets, FTP, SSH, LDAP and external database connections depend on network access and PHP extensions the platform does not document, so they may fail on WordPress VIP even though they work locally."
msgstr ""

