msgid "Move the integration behind an HTTPS API reached with the WordPress HTTP API. If that is not possible, confirm the connection with WordPress VIP support first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:604
msgid "Where the remote system cannot expose HTTP, run the transfer outside the application and push the results in."
msgstr ""

