msgid "Remote request with no caching"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:632
msgid "A WordPress HTTP API call with no transient or object-cache call anywhere in the same function."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:633
msgid "An uncached outbound request runs on every cache miss and blocks page generation until it returns. WordPress VIP says uncached remote requests should never run on the front end of a site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:634
msgid "Use wpcom_vip_file_get_contents(), which caches for 15 minutes by default, or wrap the call in a transient or object-cache read. Keep the timeout at 3 seconds or less."
msgstr ""

