#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:696
msgid "A call to wp_cache_flush()."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:697
msgid "Flushing the object cache evicts every cached value on the site at once and sends a burst of uncached traffic straight to the database. WordPress VIP code review asks for the wp_cache_* functions to be used with great caution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:698
msgid "Delete only the keys you invalidated with wp_cache_delete(), or move the data into its own cache group and version the group key."
