msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:715
msgid "WordPress VIP respects no-cache headers, and marks a response with a private Cache-Control value as uncacheable. Applied broadly, that takes the site off the edge cache and puts every visitor onto the origin."
msgstr ""

