msgid "Manual cron invocation or cron array manipulation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:777
msgid "spawn_cron(), a direct call into wp-cron.php, or direct reads and writes of the cron array."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:778
msgid "Cron Control owns the event queue on WordPress VIP, and the /wp-cron.php endpoint is disabled. Code that spawns its own cron run or rewrites the cron array fights the platform runner and can drop or duplicate events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:779
msgid "Schedule work with wp_schedule_event() and wp_schedule_single_event() and let Cron Control run it."
