msgid "Core path or behaviour constant redefined"
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1017
msgid "A plugin or theme calling define() for a core WordPress constant."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1018
msgid "These constants are set by the platform bootstrap on WordPress VIP. Redefining them from a plugin either has no effect, because the constant is already defined, or points WordPress at a path that does not exist on the platform."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1019
msgid "Remove the define(). Environment-specific configuration belongs in vip-config.php, which the platform loads before WordPress."
msgstr ""

