#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1051
msgid "error_log(), var_dump(), print_r(), phpinfo() or similar."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1052
msgid "Debug helpers can leak internal detail into a response and add noise to the platform logs. WordPress VIP code review flags them, and phpinfo() in particular discloses the environment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/scanner/class-rules.php:1053
msgid "Remove the call. Where logging is genuinely wanted, guard it behind WP_DEBUG and use the platform log rather than printing to the response."
msgstr ""

